      "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone, new to the forums here. Hope this doesn't get asked too often.</p>\n<p>I tried a couple of times to unlock the FF variants to no avail, but looking around I can only find the same bite of text about doing the prerequisite games with very little details over those. So, I have a couple of questions before I go back to run it once more.</p>\n<p>1. Do the 3 losing games have to be played one right after the other before attempting the unlock, or can you do one, then play something else etc.=</p>\n<p>2. Is Dark Watch Harpy needed in the Dark Watch team game, or is she out?</p>",
