      "created_at": "2019-08-01T13:21:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Welcome to the forums!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Someone should double check me on this because i'm going off of&nbsp;memory:</p>\n<p>1. I believe the prerequisite games need to be played in the specified order but that they can have as many games as you like in between them.</p>\n<p>2. Harpy is not included in the Dark Watch game because the Oblivaeon expansion&nbsp;wasn't out at the time these variants were released.</p>",
